                                                "sense_id": "0fc12f6b-f228-3a07-b68f-e62dc1a22e41",
                                                "text": "Plutôt que d'acquérir les quelques connaissances ouvrant la porte du certificat d’études, il préférait voyouter sur les fortifications. Ces restes de l’ancienne zone qui persistaient à peu de distance de sa maison."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4cfd8ef5-4835-30f8-ad77-4531af6de8de",
                                        "entry_id": "496457a4-6820-3e90-a404-fdfdf4fb5749",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Produit ou remède fortifiant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da761225-3d83-40b1-958f-9e5ff99de13c",
                                                "sense_id": "4cfd8ef5-4835-30f8-ad77-4531af6de8de",
                                                "text": "L’une d’entre elles émit cette remarque qu’Olympe était faible et avait besoin de prendre des fortifications. Une fille à tout faire lui monta donc un potage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bff364c7-2601-42b1-8920-34b7b1e0c100",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd0c5c04-4b0b-3e51-9886-5cee614d6734",
                        "source_sense_description": "наука",
                        "target_lang_word": "fortification",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fortification",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9d25f4d-0cc1-3b3c-ad2d-99456cf943e7",
                                        "entry_id": "8f35ce72-a97b-3687-971e-5bdc09145ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of fortifying; the art or science of fortifying places to strengthen defence against an enemy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96c48faf-f8c6-3fae-8ef9-cd772548b131",
                                        "entry_id": "8f35ce72-a97b-3687-971e-5bdc09145ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which fortifies; especially, a work or works erected to defend a place against attack; a fortified place; a fortress; a fort; a castle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71e9c0b2-663a-41cc-9d42-2f0c1e2c2c57",
                                                "sense_id": "96c48faf-f8c6-3fae-8ef9-cd772548b131",
                                                "text": "Kenett states that the military works still known by the name of Tadmarten Camp and Hook-Norton Barrow were cast up at this time ; the former, large and round, is judged to be a fortification of the Danes, and the latter, being smaller and rather a quinquangle than a square, of the Saxons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "462477ea-73d5-4a3b-8d85-3e34d5ebffee",
                                                "sense_id": "96c48faf-f8c6-3fae-8ef9-cd772548b131",
                                                "text": "“[…] We are engaged in a great work, a treatise on our river fortifications, perhaps? But since when did army officers afford the luxury of amanuenses in this simple republic?[…]”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c7693b6-8c66-49f8-965f-9f40a9ce0494",
                                                "sense_id": "96c48faf-f8c6-3fae-8ef9-cd772548b131",
                                                "text": "As Edwin Clark [...] wrote in 1850: \"[...] The lofty towers of the castle overhang the western approach to the Bridge, and the line passes into Conway through an opening pierced in the embattled wall, which entirely surrounds the town. These fortifications are in good preservation, and rank among the most perfect examples of the strongholds of the 13th century.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb9f5aa1-023e-3520-bcc6-332a922219d1",
                                        "entry_id": "8f35ce72-a97b-3687-971e-5bdc09145ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An increase in effectiveness, as by adding ingredients."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e9ada0e-ac89-41ce-a63c-5ea10cf9ed35",
                                                "sense_id": "eb9f5aa1-023e-3520-bcc6-332a922219d1",
                                                "text": "Compare the nutrition information label of a regular ready-to-eat fortified cereal with that of a presweetened brand and you'll note that, although the sweetened one's sugar content is higher, the fortification is virtually identical."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "21f63af4-3d92-33ed-af7a-3e01df4ed71c",
                                        "entry_id": "8f35ce72-a97b-3687-971e-5bdc09145ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A jagged pattern sometimes seen during an attack of migraine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4e6f0c83-8847-4b66-a713-f7726b3ce84d",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd0c5c04-4b0b-3e51-9886-5cee614d6734",
